From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim 'mithro' Ansell <me@mith.ro>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:09:11 +0930
Subject: [PATCH 03/32] main: add --flash-info option

--flash-info behaves like --detect -f and additionally calls
SPIFlash::display_info(). A full_info flag is passed through
Device::detect_flash() to every implementation (JTAG bridge and
SPI mode), and the direct SPI flash mode also honours it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F2L6L5SJYvbBUUt4DinjGC
